AltoNftRewardsAdapter::setNftReferralId
├── when referral nft id is greater than 700
│   └── it should revert
├── when referral nft id is owned by caller (self-referral)
│   └── it should revert
└── when referral nft id is valid
    ├── when setting referral id to zero (canceling referral)
    │   ├── it should update nft referral id
    │   └── it should emit NftReferralIdSet event
    ├── when setting referral id to valid owned nft
    │   ├── it should update nft referral id
    │   └── it should emit NftReferralIdSet event
    ├── when setting referral id at 700
    │   ├── it should update nft referral id
    │   └── it should emit NftReferralIdSet event
    ├── when updating referral id multiple times
    │   ├── it should update nft referral id for each call
    │   └── it should emit NftReferralIdSet event for each call
    └── when different users set referral ids
        ├── it should maintain separate referral ids
        └── it should emit NftReferralIdSet event for each user
